{"4465300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Team Rocket Project", "steam_appid": 4465300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Rocket Project  is a coop game with 1-4 players where you wield one or more of the 4 thrusters of the singular rocket and propel it to your destination! Adventure in unique levels and avoid traps in a retro futuristic world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to weave through obstacles to reach your destination! Activate a stasis field which allows your to unleash your stored velocity towards your desired location after briefly stopping you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/dcda62d6519cae9d0acbe18ddf0fad0b.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/dcda62d6519cae9d0acbe18ddf0fad0b.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/dcda62d6519cae9d0acbe18ddf0fad0b.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful of moving too quickly, rockets have no breaks! Only thrusters pointing in the opposite direction and experimental forcefields that end up boosting them further! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/72b39d1f1ade4a6a87df8af5576c6498.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/72b39d1f1ade4a6a87df8af5576c6498.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/72b39d1f1ade4a6a87df8af5576c6498.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical contact of the rocket with anything may result in immediate explosion! A completely normal phenomenon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/7b7fc6d526cb4e662995c22a0277f50e.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/7b7fc6d526cb4e662995c22a0277f50e.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/7b7fc6d526cb4e662995c22a0277f50e.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you fly towards the goal the greater the final score! Increase it by gathering coins along the way! And completing time trials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/1d2362b3cb70b8c306b377cfc81dbfb5.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/1d2362b3cb70b8c306b377cfc81dbfb5.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/1d2362b3cb70b8c306b377cfc81dbfb5.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to reach the golden cup in the end as fast as possible with the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/79d0a719a034d76c2432e1515e36a8d1.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/79d0a719a034d76c2432e1515e36a8d1.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/79d0a719a034d76c2432e1515e36a8d1.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Rocket Project  is a coop game with 1-4 players where you wield one or more of the 4 thrusters of the singular rocket and propel it to your destination! Adventure in unique levels and avoid traps in a retro futuristic world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to weave through obstacles to reach your destination! Activate a stasis field which allows your to unleash your stored velocity towards your desired location after briefly stopping you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/dcda62d6519cae9d0acbe18ddf0fad0b.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/dcda62d6519cae9d0acbe18ddf0fad0b.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/dcda62d6519cae9d0acbe18ddf0fad0b.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful of moving too quickly, rockets have no breaks! Only thrusters pointing in the opposite direction and experimental forcefields that end up boosting them further! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/72b39d1f1ade4a6a87df8af5576c6498.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/72b39d1f1ade4a6a87df8af5576c6498.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/72b39d1f1ade4a6a87df8af5576c6498.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical contact of the rocket with anything may result in immediate explosion! A completely normal phenomenon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/7b7fc6d526cb4e662995c22a0277f50e.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/7b7fc6d526cb4e662995c22a0277f50e.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/7b7fc6d526cb4e662995c22a0277f50e.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you fly towards the goal the greater the final score! Increase it by gathering coins along the way! And completing time trials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/1d2362b3cb70b8c306b377cfc81dbfb5.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/1d2362b3cb70b8c306b377cfc81dbfb5.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/1d2362b3cb70b8c306b377cfc81dbfb5.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to reach the golden cup in the end as fast as possible with the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/79d0a719a034d76c2432e1515e36a8d1.poster.avif?t=1779620346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/79d0a719a034d76c2432e1515e36a8d1.webm?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/extras/79d0a719a034d76c2432e1515e36a8d1.mp4?t=1779620346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Team Rocket Project is a coop game with 1-4 players set in a retro futuristic world where you guide a rocket! Wield one or more of the 4 thrusters of the rocket and propel it to your destination! Adventure in unique levels, avoid traps and get the highest score!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/09e94d13baf2496dde61edf8a778306ad4077878/header.jpg?t=1779620346", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/65189c9d7f26eabca3a9843a62021ab93eb4422c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779620346", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465300/65189c9d7f26eabca3a9843a62021ab93eb4422c/capsul